### 1. 회원 가입 (성공)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/members/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@test.com",
  "password": "1234"
}

### 2. 같은 이메일로 다시 가입 (중복)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/members/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@test.com",
  "password": "1234"
}

### 3. 이메일 형식 틀림
POST http://localhost:8080/api/members/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testtest.com",
  "password": "1234"
}

### 4. 비밀번호 빈칸
POST http://localhost:8080/api/members/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "new@test.com",
  "password": ""
}

### 5. 로그인 (성공)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/members/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@test.com",
  "password": "1234"
}

### 6. 로그인 비밀번호 틀림
POST http://localhost:8080/api/members/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@test.com",
  "password": "9999"
}

### 7. 로그인 없는 이메일
POST http://localhost:8080/api/members/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "nobody@test.com",
  "password": "1234"
}